From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Hertenberger <erde74@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:54:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 23/26] plan9: shutdown(Read) of a blocking stream ends the
 reads of every descriptor of its conversation (the process' fd table;
 FdState, copied by dup): close_readwrite_smoke hung since shutdown(Write)
 became a half close; the unspecified remote address (0.0.0.0, ::) is the
 loopback, as on unix and Go's net on Plan 9 (connect_error: a SYN to the
 default route timed out); shutdown_smoke runs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
